<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NovaCare upped to a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NovaCare upped to a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed that analyst Geoffrey Harris upgraded NovaCare Inc to a buy from an outperfrom rating.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
